  "reasoning": "The claim was denied for CO-197 (missing prior authorization), and the payer's 30-day retroactive authorization window is closed, making request_retro_auth impossible. Since the payer does not offer peer-to-peer review and resubmitting without authorization will result in the same denial, the only viable path to recover the allowed amount is to file a formal appeal based on medical necessity. The available action appeal_with_necessity is the correct next step to challenge the denial.",
